{"id":"atmo_sfera","lemma":"atmósfera","pos":"noun","rank":2826,"glosses":["atmosphere"],"ipa":"/adˈmosfeɾa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"atmósferas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-atm%C3%B3sfera.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me gusta la atmósfera de este restaurante.","en":"I like the atmosphere of this restaurant.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587267","words":[null,null,{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"restaurant"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"La luna no tiene atmósfera.","en":"The moon has no atmosphere.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"moon"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"El hotel tiene una atmósfera agradable.","en":"The hotel has a pleasant atmosphere.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"hotel"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"agreeable, pleasant"}]},{"text":"Este lugar tiene una atmósfera misteriosa.","en":"This place has a mysterious atmosphere.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608513","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"place"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"mysterious","l":"misterioso"}]},{"text":"La ciudad tiene una atmósfera europea.","en":"The town has a European air.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1153306","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"city"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"European","l":"europeo"}]}]}